// Force WebSocket-only transport (never fall back to the legacy `.lp`
// long-polling transport) — called as the very first executable statement
// in this module, immediately after the imports, before anything else
// (URL parsing, localStorage, firebaseConfig, initializeApp). forceWebSockets()
// has no dependency on any app/config — it only flips a static flag on the
// SDK's internal transport classes — so there is no reason to place it any
// later, and doing so removes any possible future ordering risk.
